<div class="wybot-rich-content" style="max-width: 900px; margin: 48px auto; padding: 0 20px; line-height: 1.7; color: #393939;">

  <p style="letter-spacing:2px;font-size:0.8em;color:#c9a84c;text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:8px;"><strong>The WYBOT Lineup, Explained</strong></p>
  <h2 style="color:#232739;font-size:1.8em;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:20px;">Cordless Pool Cleaning, From Entry-Level to AI-Guided Flagship</h2>

  <p>WYBOT builds one of the widest robotic pool cleaner lineups available, cordless cleaners spanning small above-ground pools up to large in-ground pools, plus a dedicated solar surface skimmer, and Full Pool Solution bundles that pair a cleaner with the skimmer for complete coverage in one purchase. Yard Automation Pros carries the full range: the A1 and B1 entry-level cleaners, the C1, C2, and C2 Vision mid-tier cleaners, the S2 High-end, S2 Solar, and S2 Solar Vision premium cleaners, the flagship S3 with self-emptying auto-docking, the F1 solar-powered surface skimmer, and eight Full Pool Solution bundles combining a cleaner with the F1.</p>

  <p>That's a lot of models, and the right starting point is almost always your pool's size and how much you want to spend on convenience features, not raw cleaning power, since every model in the lineup actually cleans the pool. The differences are in coverage area, runtime, navigation intelligence, and how hands-off the whole process is.</p>

  <img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0965/2056/9136/files/1_cb8fcf31-c01f-457e-9796-18171ee95ca0.webp?v=1789406524" alt="WYBOT S3 robotic pool cleaner with auto-docking station" style="width:100%; border-radius:8px; margin: 24px 0;" loading="lazy" width="1200" height="900">

  <hr style="border:none;border-top:1px solid #e5e5e5;margin:48px 0 0;">
  <h3 style="color:#232739;margin-top:48px;">Entry-Level: A1 and B1</h3>

  <img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0965/2056/9136/files/1_4bc42e5b-8019-4e18-bb2d-52b1ee98a796.webp?v=1789406522" alt="WYBOT A1 cordless robotic pool cleaner" style="width:100%; border-radius:8px; margin: 20px 0;" loading="lazy" width="1200" height="900">

  <p>The A1 is the simplest cleaner in the lineup, built for flat-bottom pools (max slope under 15 degrees) up to 1,076 square feet, floor cleaning only, with up to 120 minutes of runtime on dual-motor power and a 180-micron fine cotton foam filter. A cycle timer lets you schedule up to 4 cleanings a week, and it self-parks for easy retrieval. It carries a 1-year warranty.</p>

  <p>The B1 steps up to full coverage, floors, walls, waterline, steps, and slopes, on pools up to 1,150 square feet, with the same 120-minute runtime but triple-motor power, a quad-roller brush, and the same 180-micron filtration. It adds smart app control with OTA firmware updates, choosing between Full, Floor, Wall, Waterline-only, and Wall-then-Floor modes, plus patented edge-to-edge cleaning via dedicated side brushes. Also a 1-year warranty.</p>

  <h3 style="color:#232739;margin-top:40px;">Mid-Tier: C1, C2, and C2 Vision</h3>

  <img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0965/2056/9136/files/C1Green3.webp?v=1789406523" alt="WYBOT C1 cordless robotic pool cleaner" style="width:100%; border-radius:8px; margin: 20px 0;" loading="lazy" width="1200" height="900">

  <p>The C1 covers pools up to 1,615 square feet with up to 150 minutes of runtime, cleaning floors, walls, waterlines, steps, and slopes. A 180-micron ultra-fine filter and 3,038 GPH suction work with dual PVC brushes to capture debris ranging from leaves to fine sediment, and 5 cleaning modes with S-path and N-path navigation options cover different pool shapes. It carries a 2-year warranty and a 30-day price guarantee alongside the standard 30-day return window.</p>

  <p>The C2 moves up to 2,152 square feet of coverage with 180 minutes of Eco Mode runtime, adding a second filtration layer, 180-micron large-particle cartridges plus a 10-micron ultra-fine filter, for finer debris capture. Seven cleaning modes and six paths, including dedicated Turbo and Eco modes, give more granular control through the WYBOT app, and app scheduling covers up to 4 cleanings a week.</p>

  <p>The C2 Vision adds WYBOT's AI Vision technology on top of the C2's specs, an onboard camera powered by an AI visual algorithm that delivers a claimed 20&times; faster cleaning in AI Vision Mode (floor only) by targeting areas with the most visible debris rather than running a uniform pattern regardless of actual dirt distribution. It also bumps suction to 3,883 GPH and adds an eighth cleaning mode.</p>

  <hr style="border:none;border-top:1px solid #e5e5e5;margin:48px 0 0;">
  <h3 style="color:#232739;margin-top:48px;">Premium: The S2 Series</h3>

  <img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0965/2056/9136/files/1_eecaac63-bc1d-4e8e-8da0-8c18adc057dc.webp?v=1789406522" alt="WYBOT S2 High-end cordless robotic pool cleaner" style="width:100%; border-radius:8px; margin: 20px 0;" loading="lazy" width="1200" height="900">

  <p>The S2 High-end is built for large pools, up to 3,230 square feet with up to 210 minutes of runtime and a 3-hour quick charge. Triple powerful motors plus a dedicated brushless motor drive a dual-layer filtration system, cleaning floors, walls (including tiles), steps, and waterlines. It offers 6 cleaning paths and 7 modes through the app, plus 3 modes via manual switch for when you don't want to open your phone, and a cycle timer for up to 4 scheduled cleanings a week.</p>

  <p>The S2 Solar takes the same core cleaning capability and adds what WYBOT markets as the world's first underwater solar-powered robotic pool cleaner, dual charging via solar panel or DC power for over 2.5 hours of uninterrupted runtime without relying on electricity costs or worrying about battery levels. It covers up to 3,229 square feet with one-click start/return operation and a 3D Adsorption System combining a 180-micron filter box with an ultra-fine sponge.</p>

  <p>The S2 Solar Vision combines both upgrades, the dual solar/DC charging of the S2 Solar plus the AI Vision targeted-cleaning camera from the C2 Vision, delivering the claimed 20&times; faster AI Vision Mode cleaning on top of solar-independent operation and the same 3,229 square foot coverage.</p>

  <h3 style="color:#232739;margin-top:40px;">Flagship: The S3</h3>

  <img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0965/2056/9136/files/2_23c832c1-b5d0-4b4d-a0ed-f47e0dbfc2cb.webp?v=1789406524" alt="WYBOT S3 self-emptying dock" style="width:100%; border-radius:8px; margin: 20px 0;" loading="lazy" width="1200" height="900">

  <p>The S3 is the most automated cleaner in the lineup. World-first 3D mapping and smart navigation scan your pool on the first run and chart the most efficient cleaning path on every subsequent cycle, rather than treating each cleaning as a fresh start. Auto docking, charging, and self-cleaning mean the S3 returns to its dock when the battery runs low or a cycle finishes, recharges, and empties its debris into a shore-based bin, cutting your maintenance involvement down to roughly once a month rather than after every session. AI Vision technology carries over from the C2 Vision and S2 Solar Vision for optimized floor cleaning, and real-time positioning with app control lets you track the cleaner live and direct it to specific areas as needed. A large 10-liter self-sanitizing debris bin and dual solar/DC charging round it out, backed by the same 30-day return and 2-year warranty as the rest of the premium tier.</p>

  <hr style="border:none;border-top:1px solid #e5e5e5;margin:48px 0 0;">
  <h3 style="color:#232739;margin-top:48px;">F1: The Solar Surface Skimmer</h3>

  <img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0965/2056/9136/files/1-_30_1_42a692b2-f749-43e9-9d5c-87ecf5bbd466.webp?v=1789406523" alt="WYBOT F1 solar powered pool skimmer" style="width:100%; border-radius:8px; margin: 20px 0;" loading="lazy" width="1200" height="900">

  <p>None of the cleaners above patrol the surface for floating debris, that's the F1's job. It runs on a 33-watt solar panel with dual cleaning modes (Smart and Standard), tangle-free construction, and EdgeMaster technology with intelligent obstacle avoidance to patrol edges and open water alike. A 7-liter large-capacity basket with a fine filter and an anti-backflow, anti-stuck design mean debris stays collected instead of escaping back into the pool when the unit bumps an edge, and it's built to withstand continuous sun, rain, and chlorine exposure. Full remote control runs through the WYBOT app.</p>

  <h3 style="color:#232739;margin-top:40px;">Full Pool Solution Bundles</h3>

  <p>Since the F1 handles the surface and the cleaners handle floors, walls, and waterlines, pairing the two covers the entire pool without gaps. WYBOT sells Full Pool Solution bundles combining the F1 with each cleaner, A1, B1, C1, C2, C2 Vision, S2, S2 Solar, and S2 Solar Vision, at a bundled price below buying both separately. If you know you want complete surface-to-floor coverage from day one, the bundle is the more cost-effective path than adding the F1 later.</p>

