  <h3 style="color:#232739;margin-top:40px;">Maintenance and Filters</h3>

  <p>Every WYBOT cleaner uses replaceable, washable filtration, 180-micron cartridges across the lineup, with a second 10-micron ultra-fine layer on the C2, C2 Vision, S2 High-end, and S2 series for finer debris capture. Rinsing or swapping the filter after a session is the extent of routine upkeep on most models; the S3's self-sanitizing 10-liter bin and auto-docking further reduce hands-on maintenance to roughly monthly. Warranty coverage is 1 year on the A1 and B1, and 2 years across the C1 through S3 tiers, plus a standard 30-day return window on every model.</p>

  <hr style="border:none;border-top:1px solid #e5e5e5;margin:48px 0 0;">
  <h3 style="color:#232739;margin-top:48px;">Common Questions About the WYBOT Lineup</h3>

  <p><strong>What's the real difference between the tiers?</strong><br>
  Mainly pool size coverage, runtime, and how many cleaning modes and paths you get. Every model cleans effectively; the higher tiers add larger coverage, longer runtime, AI-targeted cleaning, solar independence, or full auto-docking and self-emptying.</p>

  <p><strong>Do I need the F1 skimmer too?</strong><br>
  The cleaners handle floors, walls, and waterlines. The F1 patrols the surface for floating debris before it sinks. If you want complete coverage, a Full Pool Solution bundle covers both at a lower combined price than buying separately.</p>

  <p><strong>What does AI Vision Mode actually do?</strong><br>
  On the C2 Vision, S2 Solar Vision, and S3, an onboard camera and AI algorithm identify areas with the most visible debris and prioritize them, rather than running a uniform pattern regardless of actual dirt distribution. It's floor-only and needs to be activated in the app before scheduling.</p>

  <p><strong>Does the S3 really need almost no maintenance?</strong><br>
  Its auto-docking, auto-charging, and self-emptying design means you're not manually retrieving and emptying it after every cycle, WYBOT rates typical hands-on maintenance at around once a month rather than after every session.</p>

  <p><strong>What's the warranty?</strong><br>
  1 year on the A1 and B1, 2 years on C1 through S3, all with a 30-day return window.</p>

  <p><strong>Can I finance a WYBOT cleaner?</strong><br>
  Yes, financing is available at checkout through Shop Pay Installments across the WYBOT lineup.</p>

  <h3 style="color:#232739;margin-top:40px;">Ownership, Handled</h3>

  <p>Every WYBOT product is typically delivered in about two weeks. Financing is available at checkout through Shop Pay Installments, so the cost spreads over time instead of landing as one lump sum. And you're not buying this from a manufacturer's storefront with no one to call, Yard Automation Pros provides real, US-based expert guidance before and after your purchase, from matching the right model to your pool to helping you get the most out of it once it's running. If something isn't working the way it should, you have a real person to reach, not a support ticket queue.</p>

